{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《流行都市》的「睇餸食飯」環節中，由黃婉瑩（Annie）親自教大家炮製一道開胃惹味的「酸子烤雞」。這道菜式不但酸甜開胃，更配搭了香氣四溢的黃薑飯，做法簡單，絕對適合大家在家中輕鬆試做！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">準備材料</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">烹飪步驟</p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f831e97d-f4e5-4492-b0a0-5169775caf8e.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026wjAiGBmI511785209366.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f831e97d-f4e5-4492-b0a0-5169775caf8e.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e99554bf-5d52-46c0-b37e-d43386f96b6d.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026VZGHqbFlOM1785209369.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e99554bf-5d52-46c0-b37e-d43386f96b6d.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-30T01:20:00.406149+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":102,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}